<title>GERMANY: German engineering orders fall 6.0 pct in March.</title>
<headline>German engineering orders fall 6.0 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by 6.0 percent in real terms in March from the same 1996 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the January to March period orders were 1.0 percent above the same 1996 period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    March 97   change in pct   Jan-March 97    change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -6.0	 overall		+ 1.0</p>
<p>    of which German  -5.0	 of which German    + 7.0</p>
<p>		 foreign -7.0	 foreign		- 4.0</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
